<title>UK: KPC bankers decline comment on Santa Fe bidders.</title>
<headline>KPC bankers decline comment on Santa Fe bidders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers acting on behalf of Kuwait Petroleum Corp (KPC) declined to comment on news that Du Pont's Conoco Inc had participated in the bidding for Santa Fe Exploration Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;We have no comment at this stage,&quot; said a spokesman at bank Robert Fleming. &quot;We will comment in due course when there is something to comment on.&quot;</p>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum put Santa Fe up for sale last summer. A Conoco spokeswoman said earlier that the bidding process for the British-based firm had ended.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
